I was rather thinking on having one ptr in struct bt_conn and one in struct bt_smp then when pairing starts we could have:
if (conn->auth_cb) {
   smp->auth_cb = conn->auth_cb;
} else {
  smp->auth_cb = global_smp_auth;
}

That way smp->auth_cb will not be change during pairing regardless if global or connection callbacks are altered
